      "content": "i get that, but it feels like a lot of drama for just being thirsty lol. i feel okay otherwise, just a little tired. if i just try some heavy duty electrolyte powders and maybe some apple cider vinegar for the breath, do u think that would fix it enough for me to hold off for a week or two? i really just wanna avoid the clinic if i can",
